europe which  are arguably more accurate in  representing the true cost of a gallon  of gas  people would drive a lot less and we  would be doing less damage to the  environment and so while by traditional  economic standards inflation down gas  prices down stocks up all of this stuff  looks good  for biden  i also am painfully aware of the fact  that higher gas prices encourage people  to get off of gas powered vehicles and  move over to electrics to drive less to  look for a more fuel efficient vehicle  so  these are all double-edged swords but by  the standard indicators we look at  things are looking really good doesn't  mean there isn't poverty inequality lack  of access to health care of course we  haven't solved the economy overnight but  many of the indicators republicans  themselves look at are looking very very  good
 

